PART 3
35% Greenway Plan and Profile
Provide Engineering Services for a 35% design, including plan and profile sheets for a
Greenway from the UPRR arch structure, through the LCCD managed property, and
connecting to the planned LEADS trail on Campstool Road. Greenway design will be
done in concert with the grading design and the LCCD Master Plan. Design will include
conceptual plans for any crossings of the Dry Creek drainage as necessary.
Task includes meeting with the LCCD and LEADS to review the proposed concept to
ensure the design is addressing the vision of both parties. Task includes meeting with
AVI to discuss their concept of the LEADS trail along Campstool Road. The grading
design will be done using City of Cheyenne GIS contour data.
Deliverables:
•
35% Greenway Plan and Profile Drawings
•
Estimate of Probable Construction Costs
